    "contenu": "\n      <p>For a <strong>corporate cocktail reception for 50 people</strong>, plan <strong>400 canapés</strong> for drinks, <strong>600 canapés</strong> for a lunch reception and <strong>800 canapés</strong> for a dinner reception, that is <strong>€1,495 to €2,595 excl. VAT</strong> at L'Écrin Traiteur. Here are the menu, the quantities and the full budget, drinks included.</p>\n\n      <h2>How many canapés for 50 people?</h2>\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>Package</th><th>Canapés per person</th><th>Total for 50 people</th><th>of which savoury / sweet</th><th>Budget excl. VAT</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td><strong>L'Invitation</strong></td><td>8</td><td>400 canapés</td><td>300 / 100</td><td>€1,495</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>La Réception</strong></td><td>12</td><td>600 canapés</td><td>450 / 150</td><td>€2,045</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>La Célébration</strong></td><td>16</td><td>800 canapés</td><td>600 / 200</td><td>€2,595</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      <p>The rule: two thirds to three quarters savoury canapés, the rest sweet. Savoury goes twice as fast at the start of the reception; sweet closes the moment.</p>\n\n      <h2>What menu for a cocktail reception for 50 people?</h2>\n      <p>An example with La Réception, our most requested package in quotes: 12 canapés per person, from land and sea.</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Savoury (9 canapés)</strong>: cheese gougères; pissaladière tartlet; beetroot and goat's cheese millefeuille; sweet potato, feta and olive millefeuille; tandoori chicken skewer; mini cheeseburger; marinated salmon and yellow beetroot; ratte potato with smoked salmon; grilled vegetable roll.</li>\n        <li><strong>Sweet (3 canapés)</strong>: vanilla delight, praline dome, blueberry tartlet.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>All canapés are halal and pork-free, with no alcohol in the recipes. The details of the three packages are on the page of our <a href=\"/creations/cocktails\">corporate cocktail caterer in Paris</a>.</p>\n\n      <h2>What total budget, drinks included?</h2>\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>Item</th><th>Detail</th><th>Amount excl. VAT</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td><strong>Canapés</strong></td><td>50 × La Réception at €40.90</td><td>€2,045.00</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>For the toast</strong></td><td>9 bottles of 0% Chardonnay Blanc de Blancs (1 flute per person)</td><td>€152.10</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Juice</strong></td><td>13 L of Alain Milliat juice (1 L for 4 people)</td><td>€123.50</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Water</strong></td><td>10 bottles of Evian 75 cl (1 for 5 people)</td><td>€48.00</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Delivery</strong></td><td>Paris and nearby towns</td><td>€29.00</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>Total</strong></td><td>That is €47.95 per person excl. VAT</td><td>€2,397.60</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      <p>2026 prices. The drinks are alcohol-free: a 0% Chardonnay for the toast and Alain Milliat juices. Our guide to the <a href=\"/journal/cocktail-entreprise-sans-alcool\">alcohol-free corporate cocktail reception</a> gives the quantities.</p>\n\n      <h2>And for 30, 80 or 100 people?</h2>\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>Headcount</th><th>L'Invitation (8 canapés)</th><th>La Réception (12 canapés)</th><th>La Célébration (16 canapés)</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td><strong>30 people</strong></td><td>240 canapés · €897 excl. VAT</td><td>360 canapés · €1,227 excl. VAT</td><td>480 canapés · €1,557 excl. VAT</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>50 people</strong></td><td>400 canapés · €1,495 excl. VAT</td><td>600 canapés · €2,045 excl. VAT</td><td>800 canapés · €2,595 excl. VAT</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>80 people</strong></td><td>640 canapés · €2,392 excl. VAT</td><td>960 canapés · €3,272 excl. VAT</td><td>1,280 canapés · €4,152 excl. VAT</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>100 people</strong></td><td>800 canapés · €2,990 excl. VAT</td><td>1,200 canapés · €4,090 excl. VAT</td><td>1,600 canapés · €5,190 excl. VAT</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      <p>Budgets exclude drinks and delivery (€29 excl. VAT in Paris and nearby towns). The price per person does not change with the headcount.</p>\n\n      <h2>How to organise the service for 50 people?</h2>\n      <p>Plan two buffet points rather than one: with 50 guests, a single table creates a queue and half the guests never get near it. Put out the savoury in two stages, half at the start and the other half thirty minutes later, then the sweet in the last half hour. The platters arrive arranged, ready to set down.</p>\n\n      <h2>When to order?</h2>\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>When</th><th>What to do</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td><strong>3 weeks before</strong></td><td>Set the date, the venue and an estimated headcount; ask for a quote</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>2 weeks before</strong></td><td>Choose the package according to the time: 8, 12 or 16 canapés</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>1 week before</strong></td><td>List the dietary needs (vegetarian, gluten-free, allergies)</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>2 days before</strong></td><td>Confirm the headcount, with a 10% margin</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><strong>48 hours before</strong></td><td>Final adjustment of quantities (minimum notice from 50 people)</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <h2>Ask for a quote for 50 people</h2>\n      <p>Give us the date, the venue and the time: we send you a detailed quote within 24 hours, with a company invoice showing VAT. Delivery in Paris and Île-de-France. <a href=\"/devis\">Ask for a cocktail reception quote</a>.</p>\n    ",
